{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the wild world of NIDOS</strong>, a competitive strategic card game set in nature's rawest ecosystems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In NIDOS, players compete to populate and dominate interconnected habitats using animal cards, each with unique behaviors, strengths, and resource needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Choose your animals wisely</strong>: Carnivores, herbivores, flyers, and swimmers each come with tactical advantages and drawbacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 <strong>Resource Management</strong>: Feed your animals with scarce resources like grass, water, trees, and meat \u2014 or hunt others to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Deep Strategy</strong>: Influence surrounding habitats, double your population with the &quot;outnumber&quot; mechanic, and use environmental modifiers to shift the balance of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb4 <strong>Card-Based, but Wildly Unique</strong>: Every turn feels like evolution in action.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966150?t=1759916606","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966150/e972bf76820390b48d409b4865a4b73349ca2450/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759916606","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966150/3a6405abd7d88b7824cf811dd2bf439a7fc52388/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759916606","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966150/3a6405abd7d88b7824cf811dd2bf439a7fc52388/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759916606","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the wild world of NIDOS</strong>, a competitive strategic car